    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The English version was released on May 15.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bcStory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faced with the brink of extinction due to a sudden environmental catastrophe, humanity placed its last hope in a team of android explorers, sent into the depths of space.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aboard one of these vessels, a single android has traveled alone through the cosmos for twenty long years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At last, it arrives on an uncharted planet\u2014but what awaits it there is unknown...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was localized from Japanese. If you would like to enjoy the game in Japanese, please select Japanese from the settings below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Library -&gt; Properties -&gt; General -&gt; Language</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is <strong>choice-based</strong>, but there are <strong>no multiple endings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>no restrictions on streaming or content creation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated playtime:</strong> 60\u201390 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
